  "content_id": "16136243",
  "title": "Arbitrum Network Fees",
  "description": "Arbitrum Network – Fast, Scalable Ethereum\nArbitrum brings cheaper, faster transactions to Ethereum by batching them off-chain and settlin...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZJ92MRPHEKB7JEYCNZ\">Arbitrum Network – Fast, Scalable Ethereum</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Arbitrum brings cheaper, faster transactions to Ethereum by batching them off-chain and settling on Ethereum mainnet. Fees are paid in ETH, but they’re a fraction of the cost of L1 Ethereum.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZK5KENEMP48SK960QA\">How Arbitrum Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees depend on:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Gas usage (in gwei)</b> per transaction</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Network congestion</b></p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge automatically calculates a smart gas price for you, using live Arbitrum network conditions.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZK50YS98RCYQ46GFPG\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Fastest inclusion</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Smart balance of cost and speed</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheapest, slower confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Full manual control</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>To customize:</b> Start send → Tap <b>fee settings gear</b> → Choose your speed or set custom gas.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZK0E8C6M42RJZZSHWQ\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Around <b>$0.02 to $0.10 USD</b> depending on congestion.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYZ7EZKETQ1C5V7HE2H72VG\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Arbitrum lets you use Ethereum dApps and assets for pennies instead of dollars. Edge makes fee management easy so you stay fast and cost-effective.</p><hr>",
